{"kind": "event", "event": {"schema_version": 1, "session_id": "5a3a8f2e90da48eb854cd1fe8855f1c5", "seq": 25, "turn": 0, "elapsed_ms": 20775.678042089567, "kind": "narration", "text": "`Package.swift` declares **7 targets**:\n\n1. **`SwiftStarKit`** — library target (the core kit)\n2. **`SwiftStarEngine`** — library target, depends on `SwiftStarKit`\n3. **`SwiftStarUI`** — library target (the views), depends on `SwiftStarKit`, `SwiftStarEngine`, and the `MarkdownView`/`MarkdownParser` products\n4. **`SwiftStar`** — executable target (the main app), depends on `SwiftStarKit` and `SwiftStarUI`\n5. **`SwiftStarGallery`** — executable target (the fixture gallery), depends on `SwiftStarUI`\n6. **`SwiftStarKitTests`** — test target, depends on `SwiftStarKit`\n7. **`SwiftStarIntegrationTests`** — test target, depends on `SwiftStarKit`, `SwiftStarEngine`, and `SwiftStarUI`\n\nSo that's 2 plain library targets, 2 executable targets, and 2 test targets."}}
